            "title": "Iveco, PlusAI expand partnership with autonomous truck tests in Spain",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Self-driving truck startup PlusAI said on Monday it would launch \u200bSouthern Europe's first programme to \u200ctest heavy-duty autonomous trucks, expanding its partnership with Iveco \u200cGroup brand IVECO.  The programme will develop two IVECO S\u2011Way trucks equipped with PlusAI's Level 4 autonomous driving system on a roughly \u2060300-km freight route \u200cbetween Madrid and Zaragoza, with tests starting in 2026 and a \u200dsafety operator on board.  PlusAI, headquartered \u200cin Silicon Valley with operations in Europe and the U.S., has worked with Iveco for several years on joint research and testing.",
